# Generated by hand from the Wild OS Design System tokens (design v2 Mica).
# Glass tokens are translucent; these are their solid equivalents, for the
# parts of Qt that cannot draw translucency. Neutral greys, not navy, so
# KDE apps and Write and Tables match our own windows.
#
#   ink #ffffff         ink-muted ~#cdced0    window #181a22
#   accent #8fb4ff      on-accent #0f1530     accent-text #b9cfff

